---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Data Deletion Instructions | Data Inspector">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">Data Deletion Instructions</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: September 8, 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Request account deletion</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">To request deletion of your Data Inspector account and associated personal data, contact the application owner using the contact details associated with this application. Include the email address used for your account so we can identify the correct record.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">What will be deleted</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">After verifying the request, we will delete or anonymize the account information associated with the request and remove personal data that is no longer required for legal or security purposes.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Processing time</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">We will process valid deletion requests within a reasonable period and may contact you to verify ownership of the account before completing the request.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
